EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yesterday was {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Wow, it passed by in a flash!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope it's just as fun next year!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ayer fue el Día de la Habichuela.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿No se te ha pasado volando?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} ¡El
del año que viene será aún mejor!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hier, c'était le {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}jour du haricot{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} J'ai
pas vu le temps passer, dis donc !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
J'espère que personne n'est déçu !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ieri abbiamo festeggiato il Setsubun.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Accifuffoli... È passato in un baleno!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Già non vedo l'ora che ritorni!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'du.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Vay be, göz açıp kapayıncaya
kadar geçti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Umarım gelecek yıl da bu kadar
eğlenceli olur!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sence dün herkes fasulye
atarken eğlendi mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Bence kötü şansı kovma işini
gayet iyi başardık.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Evet,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}bence bu yıl {{TAG:0005:0005:}} için
harika geçecek!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh my, {{TAG:000E:0006:06004D0072002E0006004D0073002E00}} Red Ogre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Having trouble making your escape?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Don't worry! {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is over now.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I hope you'll come back to help with
the event next year as well!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, das rote Ungeheuer!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bist du auf der Flucht vor
umherfliegenden Bohnen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Keine Sorge! Der {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bohnentag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ist
schon vorbei.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aber nächstes Jahr wirst du dich
wieder in Acht nehmen müssen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aman! {{TAG:000E:0006:06004D0072002E0006004D0073002E00}}Kırmızı Ogre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kaçmakta zorlanıyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Merak etme! {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} artık bitti.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Umarım gelecek yıl da etkinliğe
yardım etmeye gelirsin!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh my, {{TAG:000E:0006:06004D0072002E0006004D0073002E00}} Blue Ogre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Having trouble making a getaway?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Don't worry! {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is over now.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I hope you'll come back to help with
the event next year as well!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, das blaue Ungeheuer!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bist du auf der Flucht vor
umherfliegenden Bohnen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Keine Sorge! Der {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bohnentag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ist
ja jetzt vorbei.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aber nächstes Jahr wirst du dich
wieder in Acht nehmen müssen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aman! {{TAG:000E:0006:06004D0072002E0006004D0073002E00}}Mavi Ogre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kaçmakta zorlanıyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Merak etme! {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} artık bitti.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Umarım gelecek yıl da etkinliğe
yardım etmeye gelirsin!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ti auguro di festeggiare il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
al meglio qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Se sei in cerca di fagioli,
vai in {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Via degli Acquisti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Kötü şans dışarı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} İyi talih
içeri!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Umarım bu yıl güzel geçer!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Etkinliğe katılmak istersen
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Ana Cadde'deki{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} dükkânda
fasulye var mı diye bak!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ya que has venido hasta aquí,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡espero que disfrutes del Día de
la Habichuela en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Spero che ti divertirai oggi qui
{{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Per noi il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
è un evento davvero speciale!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün buradayken{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} umarım
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} usulü {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun'un{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
tadını doyasıya çıkarırsın!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun'u{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} kutlamak için küçük
bir şey hazırladım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ceplerinde yer açınca yanıma uğra!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I prepared some {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ogre masks {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}to help
everyone have fun this {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
I hope you'll wear one!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}J'ai confectionné ce {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}masque d'ogre
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}pour rendre ce {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}jour du haricot
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}encore plus drôle !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Herkes {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ogre maskeleriyle{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
bu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun'da{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} eğlensin diye
birkaç tane hazırladım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Umarım sen de birini takarsın!

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sana henüz {{TAG:0003:0025:}}bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ogre
maskesi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} vermedim mi?{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
O zaman al bakalım!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun'u{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} kutlamak için küçük
bir şey hazırladım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ceplerinde biraz yer açınca uğra!

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün bütün gün
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} hediyeleri dağıtacağım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ceplerinde yer açıp tekrar gel!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Voy a necesitar tu ayuda si quiero
hacer de esta fiesta un éxito.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Puedo contar contigo, ¿verdad?

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hoy es el Día de la Habichuela,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
así que asegúrate de lanzar muchas
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}para atraer la buena suerte.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} herkes için ne kadar
eğlenceli!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}şans rulosu{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} yemeyi de
unutma{{TAG:0003:0025:}};
böylece yılı sağlıklı geçirirsin!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Thanks for coming today!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Everyone has some beans
and is waiting to begin!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Muchas gracias por venir.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Todo el mundo está listo
para empezar la fiesta!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Grazie per essere qui oggi!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Tutti hanno fatto scorta di fagioli
e sono pronti per iniziare!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Schön, dass du gekommen bist!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Alle warten schon darauf, von 
ihren Bohnen Gebrauch zu machen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bugün geldiğin için teşekkürler!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Herkes fasulyelerini aldı ve
başlamayı bekliyor!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Now we'll have a great {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Please hang in there{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} even if you get
some beans thrown at you today!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ce {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}jour du haricot {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}s'annonce bien !{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Préparez-vous à vous faire tirer
dessus, ha ha !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Questo Setsubun sarà memorabile!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi raccomando...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} anche se ti tirano
fagioli, tu resisti!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şimdi harika bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Setsubun{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
geçireceğiz!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün üstüne fasulye yağsa bile
